  "slides": [
    {
      "id": "pb-cover",
      "title": "小豬過橋",
      "notes": "引入。先讓學生觀察圖畫，再由老師朗讀全首。\n問：小豬想做甚麼？牠為甚麼害怕？\n預期答案：牠想過橋；小木橋上下搖，牠站不穩。\n觀察：學生能否從圖畫及朗讀中找出線索。",
      "html": "<section id=\"pb-cover\" class=\"dp-slide pb-slide pb-cover\" data-slide-id=\"pb-cover\" aria-label=\"小豬過橋\"><div class=\"pb-cover-copy\"><p class=\"dp-kicker\">單元二　動感詩歌</p><h1>小豬過橋</h1><p class=\"pb-question\">小豬想做甚麼？</p><p class=\"pb-question\">牠為甚麼害怕？</p><p class=\"pb-cue-text\">先聽老師朗讀。</p></div><figure class=\"pb-cover-art\"><img src=\"./images/pig-bridge.jpg\" alt=\"小豬站在搖晃的小木橋上，樹上有麻雀，橋下有流水\"></figure></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pb-poem",
      "title": "《小豬過橋》全首",
      "notes": "先聆聽，再跟着讀。\n按「下一句」逐句高亮，學生跟讀；最後一句之後再按會重設。\n可先由老師讀一句、學生跟讀一句，再全班合讀。\n觀察：學生是否咬字清楚、在逗號及句號停頓。",
      "html": "<section id=\"pb-poem\" class=\"dp-slide pb-slide dp-sky\" data-slide-id=\"pb-poem\" aria-label=\"小豬過橋全首\"><div class=\"dp-copy\"><h2>小豬過橋</h2><div class=\"pb-poem\"><p class=\"pb-poem-line pb-step\">小木橋，上下搖，</p><p class=\"pb-poem-line pb-step\">有隻小豬想過橋。</p><p class=\"pb-poem-line pb-step\">站不穩，走不動，</p><p class=\"pb-poem-line pb-step\">踏上橋頭心亂跳，</p><p class=\"pb-poem-line pb-step\">頭上麻雀吱吱叫，</p><p class=\"pb-poem-line pb-step\">橋下流水偷偷笑，</p><p class=\"pb-poem-line pb-step\">小豬慌忙地呼叫：</p><p class=\"pb-poem-line pb-step\">「爸爸請抱我過橋。」</p></div><p class=\"pb-cue-text\">先聆聽，再跟着讀。</p></div><button type=\"button\" hidden data-action=\"pb-line-next\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></button></section>",
      "media": [],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "pb-line-next",
          "label": "下一句（最後再按重設）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pb-why",
      "title": "小豬為甚麼害怕？",
      "notes": "問：小豬為甚麼害怕？請用詩中的字詞說明。\n先讓學生回答，再按「顯示下一個答案」逐一核對（全部顯示後再按會收起）。\n預期答案：牠想過橋；小木橋上下搖，牠站不穩；牠請爸爸抱牠過橋。\n觀察：學生能否引用詩句作答。",
      "html": "<section id=\"pb-why\" class=\"dp-slide pb-slide dp-cream\" data-slide-id=\"pb-why\" aria-label=\"小豬為甚麼害怕\"><div class=\"dp-copy\"><h2>小豬為甚麼害怕？</h2><div class=\"pb-answers\"><p class=\"pb-answer pb-step\">牠想過橋。</p><p class=\"pb-answer pb-step\">小木橋上下搖，牠站不穩。</p><p class=\"pb-answer pb-step\">牠請爸爸抱牠過橋。</p></div><p class=\"pb-cue-text pb-center\">用詩中的字詞說明。</p></div><button type=\"button\" hidden data-action=\"pb-answer-next\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></button></section>",
