    {
      "id": "pb-actions",
      "title": "三個動作",
      "notes": "三個動作：上下搖（雙手輕輕上下擺）、站不穩（坐着左右輕搖）、抱（雙手抱自己）。\n按「下一個動作」逐一放大並示範動畫；學生原位輕做。第四次按會回到全部顯示。\n提醒：聽到字詞才加入，動作要輕。\n觀察：學生能否在聽到字詞時才做動作。",
      "html": "<section id=\"pb-actions\" class=\"dp-slide pb-slide dp-sky\" data-slide-id=\"pb-actions\" aria-label=\"三個動作\"><div class=\"dp-copy pb-center\"><h2 class=\"pb-left\">三個動作</h2><div class=\"pb-move-cards\"><div class=\"pb-move-card pb-step\"><span class=\"pb-move-icon pb-anim-updown\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🙌</span><h3>上下搖</h3><p>雙手輕輕上下擺</p></div><div class=\"pb-move-card pb-step\"><span class=\"pb-move-icon pb-anim-sway\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🧍</span><h3>站不穩</h3><p>坐着左右輕搖</p></div><div class=\"pb-move-card pb-step\"><span class=\"pb-move-icon pb-anim-hug\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🤗</span><h3>抱</h3><p>雙手抱自己</p></div></div><p class=\"pb-cue-text\">原位輕做，聽到字詞才加入。</p></div><button type=\"button\" hidden data-action=\"pb-move-next\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></button></section>",
