    {
      "id": "pb-sfx",
      "title": "三種聲效",
      "notes": "三種聲效：心亂跳（「噗噗噗」或輕拍胸口）、吱吱叫（「吱吱吱吱」）、偷偷笑（輕搓雙手或輕聲「嘻嘻」）。\n按「下一個聲效」逐一亮起並播放動畫，全班試做；選一個做法，全班一起試。\n觀察：聲效是否輕、短，是否配合字詞。",
      "html": "<section id=\"pb-sfx\" class=\"dp-slide pb-slide dp-cream\" data-slide-id=\"pb-sfx\" aria-label=\"三種聲效\"><div class=\"dp-copy\"><h2>三種聲效</h2><div class=\"pb-sfx\"><div class=\"pb-sfx-row pb-step\"><strong>心亂跳</strong><span class=\"pb-sfx-visual\"><span class=\"pb-heart\" aria-hidden=\"true\">❤️</span></span><span class=\"pb-sfx-how\">「噗噗噗」或輕拍胸口</span></div><div class=\"pb-sfx-row pb-step\"><strong>吱吱叫</strong><span class=\"pb-sfx-visual\"><span class=\"pb-chirps\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></span><span class=\"pb-sfx-how\">「吱吱吱吱」</span></div><div class=\"pb-sfx-row pb-step\"><strong>偷偷笑</strong><span class=\"pb-sfx-visual\"><span class=\"pb-giggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🤭</span></span><span class=\"pb-sfx-how\">輕搓雙手或輕聲「嘻嘻」</span></div></div><p class=\"pb-cue-text pb-center\">選一個做法，全班一起試。</p></div><button type=\"button\" hidden data-action=\"pb-sfx-next\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></button></section>",
