      "id": "pb-perform",
      "title": "全班合演《小豬過橋》",
      "notes": "全班合演：一起朗讀；看老師指揮，在指定字詞加入動作或聲效。\n按「下一句」逐句高亮；有動作（🙌）或聲效（🔊）的字詞會跳出提示。最後一句之後再按會重設。\n建議：第一次只朗讀；第二次加入動作；第三次加入聲效。\n觀察：學生能否保持穩定拍子，並在正確字詞加入動作或聲效。",
      "html": "<section id=\"pb-perform\" class=\"dp-slide pb-slide dp-sky\" data-slide-id=\"pb-perform\" aria-label=\"全班合演小豬過橋\"><div class=\"dp-copy\"><h2>全班合演《小豬過橋》</h2><div class=\"pb-poem pb-perform\"><p class=\"pb-perform-line pb-step\">小木橋，<mark class=\"pb-cue pb-cue-move\" data-icon=\"🙌\">上下搖</mark>，</p><p class=\"pb-perform-line pb-step\">有隻小豬想過橋。</p><p class=\"pb-perform-line pb-step\"><mark class=\"pb-cue pb-cue-move\" data-icon=\"🙌\">站不穩</mark>，走不動，</p><p class=\"pb-perform-line pb-step\">踏上橋頭<mark class=\"pb-cue pb-cue-sfx\" data-icon=\"🔊\">心亂跳</mark>，</p><p class=\"pb-perform-line pb-step\">頭上麻雀<mark class=\"pb-cue pb-cue-sfx\" data-icon=\"🔊\">吱吱叫</mark>，</p><p class=\"pb-perform-line pb-step\">橋下流水<mark class=\"pb-cue pb-cue-sfx\" data-icon=\"🔊\">偷偷笑</mark>，</p><p class=\"pb-perform-line pb-step\">小豬慌忙地呼叫：</p><p class=\"pb-perform-line pb-step\">「爸爸請<mark class=\"pb-cue pb-cue-move\" data-icon=\"🙌\">抱</mark>我過橋。」</p></div><p class=\"pb-cue-text\">一起朗讀；看老師指揮，在指定字詞加入動作或聲效。<span class=\"pb-legend\"><mark class=\"pb-cue pb-cue-move\">動作</mark><mark class=\"pb-cue pb-cue-sfx\">聲效</mark></span></p></div><button type=\"button\" hidden data-action=\"pb-perform-next\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></button></section>",
